# Disabled: scripts/build_deb_cache.py only globs *.list, so this
# `.list.disabled` suffix means it's never picked up as a live source.
# repo.tihmstar.net is real (still serves signed content — see
# misc/README.md's "etasonATV / tihmstar-untether provenance"),
# but its live Packages/Packages.gz has been observed out of sync with its
# own Release file's declared size ("Mirror sync in progress?" per apt's
# own message) — a small, low-traffic personal repo with no guarantee of
# staying self-consistent run to run. The one package this project ever
# needed from it, net.tihmstar.etasonuntether, is handled entirely through
# package/local_only_debs.txt instead (the same local file:// repo
# mechanism "essential" already uses) — see that file's own comment.
# Re-enable by dropping the `.disabled` suffix if a real future need for
# live resolution against this repo comes up.
deb http://repo.tihmstar.net/ ./
